== CANON-19 (r3.63): Assert(Condition, Message) prints the message after the
== category when the condition is false.
Module Runtime.DebugAssertMessage

Use Std.Debug

Check(Total Integer) :
    Assert(Total > 0, "Total must be positive")
    PutLn("checked ", Total)
;

Main :
    Check(5)
    Check(-1)
;
